===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# The [[northernmost]] point on [[celestial]] [[body|bodies]] other than [[Earth]].
# {{lb|en|electromagnetism}} The [[positive]] [[pole]] of a [[magnetic]] [[dipole]] that seeks geographic [[north]].

