* {{sense|positive magnetic pole}} {{l|en|positive pole}}, {{l|en|north-seeking pole}}, {{l|en|N-pole}}

====Antonyms====
* {{antsense|positive magnetic pole}} {{l|en|negative pole}}, {{l|en|south pole}}, {{l|en|south-seeking pole}}, {{l|en|S-pole}}

